abstract: "A cited dataset of NASA reduced-gravity fire tests, two flammability-limit models with held-out Earth checks, and a timestamped forecast of the oxygen limit for thin cellulose at lunar gravity and habitat pressure (8.2 psia). NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026, Flame in Freefall."
keywords: [flammability, lunar gravity, partial gravity, spacecraft fire safety, NASA Space Apps]
